## 9. Performance: Categoricals & Streaming

Cast string columns to `Categorical` for memory savings. For datasets that exceed RAM,
use `LazyFrame` + streaming to process in batches.

::: {#c845ac73 .cell execution_count=9}
``` {.python .cell-code}
df = (
    pl.scan_ipc("large_dataset.arrow")
    .filter(pl.col("vol") > 0.3)
    .group_by("ticker")
    .agg(pl.col("ret").mean())
    .with_columns(pl.col("ticker").cast(pl.Categorical))  # <1>
    .collect(streaming=True)  # <2>
)
```
:::


1. Tickers as `Categorical` — integers under the hood, much less memory.
1. Streaming execution — processes in batches instead of loading everything at once.

